; ==========================================================================
; STELLAR MAZE RACE  -  VM1 builds a maze, VM2 and VM3 race it  (3 programs, 1 file)
; ==========================================================================
; Load this ONE file - VM1 at $4000, VM2 at $5000, VM3 at $6000 - then cold-boot
; and press a key. VM1 carves a random 19 x 10 maze, drawn twice side by side,
; copies it into VM2 and VM3 with $DC COPYBVMXVMY and triggers both with $D3
; COPYVXY. VM2 (left) solves it right hand on the wall, VM3 (right) left hand on
; the wall, at the same time. The finish is decided with multitasking off for a
; moment ($C7), so exactly one of them is 1st; the 2nd prints the score.
;
; VT100: cursor addressing and reverse video (the walls) only.
;
; HW-VERIFIED on the Elf2K (V0061.34), 2026-09-26 (Craig).
;
; VERIFICATION (Firmware-Math/mazerace_verify.py, V0061.33, three-VM cold boot): four mazes, the first booted into DIRTY grid RAM and the second a RERUN from the memory the first left (no reload) - it draws a NEW maze; both copies equal VM1's perfect 19 x 10 maze; VM2's and VM3's grids have its walls exactly ($DC); each copy's final 'o' is exactly the solution and '.' only off it; each step count matches a Python walk with that hand; exactly one 1st, printed first, and the score line is right. Each hand won at least once. About 13-16 million 1802 instructions (~1.5 min at 3 MHz) + ~16 KB of output.
; The first build ran perfectly on the Elf2K (2026-09-24) but a rerun without
; reloading replayed the old maze: the grid was loaded data, carved in place. VM1
; now rebuilds it with FILLMEM at the start of every run. Fix HW-verified 2026-09-26.
;
; VM1: 180   VM2: 167   VM3: 167 STELLAR commands.

; --------------------------------------------------------------------------
; DISASSEMBLY  -  VM1 ($4000): builds the maze, hands it over  -  commented out; the loader skips it
; --------------------------------------------------------------------------

; D 4000 CD             START
; D 4001 11 0F 00 0A    LOADXI R15 000A
; D 4005 11 0C 00 28    LOADXI R12 0028                    The grid stride
; D 4009 11 0A 00 02    LOADXI R10 0002
; D 400D 11 03 08 00    LOADXI R3 0800
; D 4011 11 04 0B 97    LOADXI R4 0B97
; D 4015 FB 34 58       FILLMEMXY R3..R4 'X'               A fresh grid: everything a sentinel ...
; D 4018 11 03 08 28    LOADXI R3 0828                     row 0
; D 401C 11 05 00 15    LOADXI R5 0015
; CLR:
; D 4020 23 00 34       COPYXY R3 -> R4
; D 4023 52 04 00 26    ADDXI R4 0026
; D 4027 FB 34 23       FILLMEMXY R3..R4 '#'               ... then each maze row solid, unvisited
; D 402A 52 03 00 28    ADDXI R3 0028
; D 402E 43 05          DECX R5
; D 4030 8C 05          TESTXZ R5
; D 4032 A1 00 20       IFFALSEI CLR
; D 4035 D0 11          SHAREVM on, read-only              The solvers may read us (the $DC source)
; WAIT2:
; D 4037 D1 22          TESTVM 2 RW                        Has VM2 opened itself read/write?
; D 4039 A1 00 37       IFFALSEI WAIT2
; WAIT3:
; D 403C D1 32          TESTVM 3 RW                        And VM3?
; D 403E A1 00 3C       IFFALSEI WAIT3
; D 4041 11 0E 06 00    LOADXI R14 0600
; D 4045 C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14
; D 4047 11 0E 06 62    LOADXI R14 0662
; D 404B C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14
; SEED:
; D 404D C3             RAND                               Spin the generator until a key comes - every maze differs
; D 404E CC             SERST
; D 404F A1 00 4D       IFFALSEI SEED
; D 4052 CB             SERIN                              and throw the key away
; D 4053 C7 00          SETMULTI 00                        Multitasking OFF: the solvers are only waiting
; D 4055 11 0E 06 90    LOADXI R14 0690
; D 4059 C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14
; D 405B 11 0E 06 D2    LOADXI R14 06D2
; D 405F C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14                       Reverse video: a space is a wall block
; D 4061 11 0D 00 03    LOADXI R13 0003
; D 4065 11 03 00 15    LOADXI R3 0015
; BLK:
; D 4069 11 0E 00 01    LOADXI R14 0001
; D 406D BD 01 E1       CALL POSXY
; D 4070 11 0E 07 C0    LOADXI R14 07C0
; D 4074 C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14                       the left copy
; D 4076 11 0E 00 29    LOADXI R14 0029
; D 407A BD 01 E1       CALL POSXY
; D 407D 11 0E 07 C0    LOADXI R14 07C0
; D 4081 C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14                       the right copy
; D 4083 42 0D          INCX R13
; D 4085 43 03          DECX R3
; D 4087 8C 03          TESTXZ R3
; D 4089 A1 00 69       IFFALSEI BLK
; D 408C 11 0E 06 D7    LOADXI R14 06D7
; D 4090 C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14
; D 4092 11 07 00 20    LOADXI R7 0020                     R7 = the carving character, a normal-video space
; D 4096 11 0B 00 29    LOADXI R11 0029
; D 409A BD 01 BF       CALL DRAW                          The ways in and out (screen only)
; D 409D 11 0B 03 6D    LOADXI R11 036D
; D 40A1 BD 01 BF       CALL DRAW
; D 40A4 11 06 00 51    LOADXI R6 0051
; D 40A8 10 00 20       LOADAI 0020
; D 40AB 2F 06 08 00    WRITEIDX R6 0800                   Carve the first cell
; D 40AF 23 00 6B       COPYXY R6 -> R11
; D 40B2 BD 01 BF       CALL DRAW
; D 40B5 11 01 0D 00    LOADXI R1 0D00                     R1 = stack pointer
; D 40B9 3A 02 61       COPYXMY R6 -> M(R1)                push it
; D 40BC 52 01 00 02    ADDXI R1 0002
; LOOP:
; D 40C0 86 01 0D 00    TESTXI R1 0D00
; D 40C4 A0 01 88       IFTRUEI BUILT                      Stack empty: every cell visited
; D 40C7 23 00 18       COPYXY R1 -> R8
; D 40CA 53 08 00 02    SUBXI R8 0002
; D 40CE 39 02 82       COPYMXY M(R8) -> R2                R2 = current cell
; D 40D1 11 05 00 00    LOADXI R5 0000                     R5 = unvisited neighbours found
; D 40D5 11 09 0F 00    LOADXI R9 0F00
; D 40D9 23 00 26       COPYXY R2 -> R6
; D 40DC 52 06 00 02    ADDXI R6 0002                      right
; D 40E0 2E 06 08 00    READIDX R6 0800
; D 40E4 81 00 23       TESTAI 0023                        '#' = unvisited ('X' = off the edge)
; D 40E7 A1 00 F3       IFFALSEI NB0
; D 40EA 3A 02 69       COPYXMY R6 -> M(R9)                a candidate
; D 40ED 52 09 00 02    ADDXI R9 0002
; D 40F1 42 05          INCX R5
; NB0:
; D 40F3 23 00 26       COPYXY R2 -> R6
; D 40F6 53 06 00 02    SUBXI R6 0002                      left
; D 40FA 2E 06 08 00    READIDX R6 0800
; D 40FE 81 00 23       TESTAI 0023                        '#' = unvisited ('X' = off the edge)
; D 4101 A1 01 0D       IFFALSEI NB1
; D 4104 3A 02 69       COPYXMY R6 -> M(R9)                a candidate
; D 4107 52 09 00 02    ADDXI R9 0002
; D 410B 42 05          INCX R5
; NB1:
; D 410D 23 00 26       COPYXY R2 -> R6
; D 4110 52 06 00 50    ADDXI R6 0050                      down
; D 4114 2E 06 08 00    READIDX R6 0800
; D 4118 81 00 23       TESTAI 0023                        '#' = unvisited ('X' = off the edge)
; D 411B A1 01 27       IFFALSEI NB2
; D 411E 3A 02 69       COPYXMY R6 -> M(R9)                a candidate
; D 4121 52 09 00 02    ADDXI R9 0002
; D 4125 42 05          INCX R5
; NB2:
; D 4127 23 00 26       COPYXY R2 -> R6
; D 412A 53 06 00 50    SUBXI R6 0050                      up
; D 412E 2E 06 08 00    READIDX R6 0800
; D 4132 81 00 23       TESTAI 0023                        '#' = unvisited ('X' = off the edge)
; D 4135 A1 01 41       IFFALSEI NB3
; D 4138 3A 02 69       COPYXMY R6 -> M(R9)                a candidate
; D 413B 52 09 00 02    ADDXI R9 0002
; D 413F 42 05          INCX R5
; NB3:
; D 4141 8C 05          TESTXZ R5
; D 4143 A1 01 4D       IFFALSEI PICK
; D 4146 53 01 00 02    SUBXI R1 0002                      Dead end: pop
; D 414A B0 00 C0       GAL LOOP
; PICK:
; D 414D C3             RAND                               A random one of them
; D 414E 21 06          COPYAX Acc -> R6
; D 4150 4D 65          DIVXY R6 / R5
; D 4152 27             COPYREMA
; D 4153 21 08          COPYAX Acc -> R8
; D 4155 50 88 08       ADDXYZ R8 + R8 -> R8               x2: a word each
; D 4158 52 08 0F 00    ADDXI R8 0F00
; D 415C 39 02 86       COPYMXY M(R8) -> R6                R6 = the chosen cell
; D 415F 50 26 08       ADDXYZ R2 + R6 -> R8
; D 4162 4D 8A          DIVXY R8 / R10
; D 4164 25             COPYMAA
; D 4165 21 08          COPYAX Acc -> R8                   R8 = the wall between = (cur + next) / 2
; D 4167 10 00 20       LOADAI 0020
; D 416A 2F 08 08 00    WRITEIDX R8 0800                   knock it down
; D 416E 2F 06 08 00    WRITEIDX R6 0800                   and visit the cell
; D 4172 23 00 8B       COPYXY R8 -> R11
; D 4175 BD 01 BF       CALL DRAW
; D 4178 23 00 6B       COPYXY R6 -> R11
; D 417B BD 01 BF       CALL DRAW
; D 417E 3A 02 61       COPYXMY R6 -> M(R1)                push it
; D 4181 52 01 00 02    ADDXI R1 0002
; D 4185 B0 00 C0       GAL LOOP
; BUILT:
; D 4188 11 03 08 00    LOADXI R3 0800                     The grid is at the same place in all three VMs
; D 418C 11 06 00 04    LOADXI R6 0004
; COPY:
; D 4190 D3 21 33       COPYVXY save R3 -> VM2 R3          VM2's R3 = the same address, in VM2
; D 4193 D3 31 33       COPYVXY save R3 -> VM3 R3          and VM3's
; D 4196 DC 13 23 F0    COPYBVMXVMY VM1 R3 -> VM2 R3 F0    240 bytes to VM2
; D 419A DC 13 33 F0    COPYBVMXVMY VM1 R3 -> VM3 R3 F0    240 bytes to VM3
; D 419E 52 03 00 F0    ADDXI R3 00F0
; D 41A2 43 06          DECX R6
; D 41A4 8C 06          TESTXZ R6
; D 41A6 A1 01 90       IFFALSEI COPY
; D 41A9 11 0B 00 01    LOADXI R11 0001
; D 41AD D3 21 BB       COPYVXY save RB -> VM2 RB          Trigger VM2
; D 41B0 D3 31 BB       COPYVXY save RB -> VM3 RB          Trigger VM3
; D 41B3 11 0E 06 DC    LOADXI R14 06DC
; D 41B7 C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14
; D 41B9 C7 01          SETMULTI 01                        Multitasking back ON - let them race
; D 41BB 00             HALT                               VM1 is done
; D 41BC F0 00 00       BREAK
; DRAW:
; D 41BF 4D BC          DIVXY R11 / R12                    row + 1, column
; D 41C1 25             COPYMAA
; D 41C2 21 0D          COPYAX Acc -> R13
; D 41C4 52 0D 00 02    ADDXI R13 0002
; D 41C8 27             COPYREMA
; D 41C9 21 0E          COPYAX Acc -> R14
; D 41CB 52 0E 00 01    ADDXI R14 0001
; D 41CF BD 01 E1       CALL POSXY
; D 41D2 22 07          COPYXA R7 -> Acc
; D 41D4 C9             SEROUT
; D 41D5 52 0E 00 28    ADDXI R14 0028
; D 41D9 BD 01 E1       CALL POSXY
; D 41DC 22 07          COPYXA R7 -> Acc
; D 41DE C9             SEROUT
; D 41DF BE 00          RETURN
; POSXY:
; D 41E1 CA 1B          SEROUTI 1B
; D 41E3 CA 5B          SEROUTI 5B '['
; D 41E5 4D DF          DIVXY R13 / R15
; D 41E7 25             COPYMAA
; D 41E8 4E 00 30       ADDAI 0030
; D 41EB C9             SEROUT
; D 41EC 27             COPYREMA
; D 41ED 4E 00 30       ADDAI 0030
; D 41F0 C9             SEROUT
; D 41F1 CA 3B          SEROUTI 3B ';'
; D 41F3 4D EF          DIVXY R14 / R15
; D 41F5 25             COPYMAA
; D 41F6 4E 00 30       ADDAI 0030
; D 41F9 C9             SEROUT
; D 41FA 27             COPYREMA
; D 41FB 4E 00 30       ADDAI 0030
; D 41FE C9             SEROUT
; D 41FF CA 48          SEROUTI 48 'H'
; D 4201 BE 00          RETURN

; --------------------------------------------------------------------------
; DISASSEMBLY  -  VM2 ($5000): right hand on the wall  -  commented out; the loader skips it
; --------------------------------------------------------------------------

; D 5000 CD             START
; D 5001 11 0B 00 00    LOADXI R11 0000                    RB = 0: VM1 sets it to 1 when the maze is ours
; D 5005 11 01 00 00    LOADXI R1 0000                     R1 = 0: the other solver has not finished (it sets R1 = 1 when it does)
; D 5009 D0 12          SHAREVM on, read/write             VM1 may write our memory and registers
; D 500B 11 0F 00 0A    LOADXI R15 000A
; D 500F 11 0C 00 28    LOADXI R12 0028
; WAIT:
; D 5013 86 0B 00 01    TESTXI R11 0001
; D 5017 A1 00 13       IFFALSEI WAIT                      Wait for the trigger
; D 501A 11 0E 06 00    LOADXI R14 0600
; D 501E C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14
; D 5020 11 05 03 45    LOADXI R5 0345                     R5 = the bottom-right cell
; D 5024 11 02 00 51    LOADXI R2 0051                     R2 = where we are
; D 5028 11 03 00 02    LOADXI R3 0002                     R3 = heading: 0 up 1 right 2 down 3 left
; D 502C 10 00 6F       LOADAI 006F
; D 502F 2F 02 08 00    WRITEIDX R2 0800
; D 5033 11 0A 00 6F    LOADXI R10 006F
; D 5037 23 00 2B       COPYXY R2 -> R11
; D 503A BD 01 7A       CALL DRAW
; D 503D 11 09 00 00    LOADXI R9 0000                     R9 = steps
; STEP:
; D 5041 87 25          TESTXY R2 = R5
; D 5043 A0 00 E0       IFTRUEI SOLVED
; D 5046 23 00 34       COPYXY R3 -> R4
; D 5049 52 04 00 01    ADDXI R4 0001                      first try: heading +1 (right hand) or +3 = -1 (left)
; D 504D 86 04 00 04    TESTXI R4 0004
; D 5051 A0 00 65       IFTRUEI W4
; D 5054 86 04 00 05    TESTXI R4 0005
; D 5058 A0 00 6C       IFTRUEI W5
; D 505B 86 04 00 06    TESTXI R4 0006
; D 505F A0 00 73       IFTRUEI W6
; D 5062 B0 00 77       GAL TRY
; W4:
; D 5065 11 04 00 00    LOADXI R4 0000
; D 5069 B0 00 77       GAL TRY
; W5:
; D 506C 11 04 00 01    LOADXI R4 0001
; D 5070 B0 00 77       GAL TRY
; W6:
; D 5073 11 04 00 02    LOADXI R4 0002
; TRY:
; D 5077 BD 01 41       CALL OFF                           R6 = the wall that way, R7 = the cell beyond
; D 507A 2E 06 08 00    READIDX R6 0800
; D 507E 81 00 23       TESTAI 0023
; D 5081 A1 00 92       IFFALSEI FOUND                     Open
; D 5084 8C 04          TESTXZ R4
; D 5086 A1 00 8D       IFFALSEI TL                        Blocked: turn left one
; D 5089 11 04 00 04    LOADXI R4 0004
; TL:
; D 508D 43 04          DECX R4
; D 508F B0 00 77       GAL TRY
; FOUND:
; D 5092 42 09          INCX R9
; D 5094 2E 07 08 00    READIDX R7 0800
; D 5098 81 00 6F       TESTAI 006F
; D 509B A0 00 BC       IFTRUEI BACK                       Stepping back onto the path
; D 509E 10 00 6F       LOADAI 006F
; D 50A1 2F 06 08 00    WRITEIDX R6 0800
; D 50A5 2F 07 08 00    WRITEIDX R7 0800
; D 50A9 11 0A 00 6F    LOADXI R10 006F
; D 50AD 23 00 6B       COPYXY R6 -> R11
; D 50B0 BD 01 7A       CALL DRAW
; D 50B3 23 00 7B       COPYXY R7 -> R11
; D 50B6 BD 01 7A       CALL DRAW
; D 50B9 B0 00 D7       GAL MOVED
; BACK:
; D 50BC 10 00 2E       LOADAI 002E
; D 50BF 2F 02 08 00    WRITEIDX R2 0800
; D 50C3 2F 06 08 00    WRITEIDX R6 0800
; D 50C7 11 0A 00 2E    LOADXI R10 002E
; D 50CB 23 00 2B       COPYXY R2 -> R11
; D 50CE BD 01 7A       CALL DRAW
; D 50D1 23 00 6B       COPYXY R6 -> R11
; D 50D4 BD 01 7A       CALL DRAW
; MOVED:
; D 50D7 23 00 72       COPYXY R7 -> R2
; D 50DA 23 00 43       COPYXY R4 -> R3
; D 50DD B0 00 41       GAL STEP
; SOLVED:
; D 50E0 C7 00          SETMULTI 00                        Lock
; D 50E2 86 01 00 01    TESTXI R1 0001
; D 50E6 A0 01 08       IFTRUEI SECOND                     R1 = 1: the other one got here first and told us
; D 50E9 11 07 00 01    LOADXI R7 0001
; D 50ED D3 31 17       COPYVXY save R7 -> VM3 R1          Tell the other: you're 2nd
; D 50F0 D3 31 89       COPYVXY save R9 -> VM3 R8          and how many steps we took
; D 50F3 11 0E 06 22    LOADXI R14 0622
; D 50F7 C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14                       1st
; D 50F9 23 00 94       COPYXY R9 -> R4
; D 50FC BD 01 B8       CALL PRNUM
; D 50FF 11 0E 06 5E    LOADXI R14 065E
; D 5103 C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14
; D 5105 C7 01          SETMULTI 01                        Unlock (held through the printing)
; D 5107 00             HALT                               The winner is done
; SECOND:
; D 5108 23 00 86       COPYXY R8 -> R6                    R6 = the winner's steps (PRNUM uses R8)
; D 510B 11 0E 06 40    LOADXI R14 0640
; D 510F C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14                       2nd
; D 5111 23 00 94       COPYXY R9 -> R4
; D 5114 BD 01 B8       CALL PRNUM
; D 5117 11 0E 06 5E    LOADXI R14 065E
; D 511B C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14
; D 511D 11 0E 06 65    LOADXI R14 0665
; D 5121 C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14                       The score line
; D 5123 23 00 64       COPYXY R6 -> R4
; D 5126 BD 01 B8       CALL PRNUM
; D 5129 11 0E 06 81    LOADXI R14 0681
; D 512D C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14
; D 512F 23 00 94       COPYXY R9 -> R4
; D 5132 BD 01 B8       CALL PRNUM
; D 5135 11 0E 06 8C    LOADXI R14 068C
; D 5139 C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14
; D 513B C7 01          SETMULTI 01                        Unlock
; D 513D 00             HALT
; D 513E F0 00 00       BREAK
; OFF:
; D 5141 23 00 26       COPYXY R2 -> R6
; D 5144 86 04 00 00    TESTXI R4 0000
; D 5148 A0 01 60       IFTRUEI OU
; D 514B 86 04 00 01    TESTXI R4 0001
; D 514F A0 01 67       IFTRUEI OR
; D 5152 86 04 00 02    TESTXI R4 0002
; D 5156 A0 01 6E       IFTRUEI OD
; D 5159 53 06 00 01    SUBXI R6 0001                      left
; D 515D B0 01 72       GAL ON
; OU:
; D 5160 53 06 00 28    SUBXI R6 0028
; D 5164 B0 01 72       GAL ON
; OR:
; D 5167 52 06 00 01    ADDXI R6 0001
; D 516B B0 01 72       GAL ON
; OD:
; D 516E 52 06 00 28    ADDXI R6 0028
; ON:
; D 5172 50 66 07       ADDXYZ R6 + R6 -> R7
; D 5175 51 72 07       SUBXYZ R7 - R2 -> R7               next = 2 x wall - here
; D 5178 BE 00          RETURN
; DRAW:
; D 517A C7 00          SETMULTI 00                        No switching mid escape sequence: the other solver draws too
; D 517C 4D BC          DIVXY R11 / R12                    row + 1, column
; D 517E 25             COPYMAA
; D 517F 21 0D          COPYAX Acc -> R13
; D 5181 52 0D 00 02    ADDXI R13 0002
; D 5185 27             COPYREMA
; D 5186 21 0E          COPYAX Acc -> R14
; D 5188 52 0E 00 01    ADDXI R14 0001
; D 518C BD 01 96       CALL POSXY
; D 518F 22 0A          COPYXA R10 -> Acc
; D 5191 C9             SEROUT
; D 5192 C7 01          SETMULTI 01
; D 5194 BE 00          RETURN
; POSXY:
; D 5196 CA 1B          SEROUTI 1B
; D 5198 CA 5B          SEROUTI 5B '['
; D 519A 4D DF          DIVXY R13 / R15
; D 519C 25             COPYMAA
; D 519D 4E 00 30       ADDAI 0030
; D 51A0 C9             SEROUT
; D 51A1 27             COPYREMA
; D 51A2 4E 00 30       ADDAI 0030
; D 51A5 C9             SEROUT
; D 51A6 CA 3B          SEROUTI 3B ';'
; D 51A8 4D EF          DIVXY R14 / R15
; D 51AA 25             COPYMAA
; D 51AB 4E 00 30       ADDAI 0030
; D 51AE C9             SEROUT
; D 51AF 27             COPYREMA
; D 51B0 4E 00 30       ADDAI 0030
; D 51B3 C9             SEROUT
; D 51B4 CA 48          SEROUTI 48 'H'
; D 51B6 BE 00          RETURN
; PRNUM:
; D 51B8 11 08 00 00    LOADXI R8 0000
; PN1:
; D 51BC 4D 4F          DIVXY R4 / R15
; D 51BE 27             COPYREMA
; D 51BF 70 00          PUSHA Acc                          digits onto the stack
; D 51C1 42 08          INCX R8
; D 51C3 25             COPYMAA
; D 51C4 21 04          COPYAX Acc -> R4
; D 51C6 8C 04          TESTXZ R4
; D 51C8 A1 01 BC       IFFALSEI PN1
; PN2:
; D 51CB 71 00          POPA Acc
; D 51CD 4E 00 30       ADDAI 0030
; D 51D0 C9             SEROUT
; D 51D1 43 08          DECX R8
; D 51D3 8C 08          TESTXZ R8
; D 51D5 A1 01 CB       IFFALSEI PN2
; D 51D8 BE 00          RETURN

; --------------------------------------------------------------------------
; DISASSEMBLY  -  VM3 ($6000): left hand on the wall  -  commented out; the loader skips it
; --------------------------------------------------------------------------

; D 6000 CD             START
; D 6001 11 0B 00 00    LOADXI R11 0000                    RB = 0: VM1 sets it to 1 when the maze is ours
; D 6005 11 01 00 00    LOADXI R1 0000                     R1 = 0: the other solver has not finished (it sets R1 = 1 when it does)
; D 6009 D0 12          SHAREVM on, read/write             VM1 may write our memory and registers
; D 600B 11 0F 00 0A    LOADXI R15 000A
; D 600F 11 0C 00 28    LOADXI R12 0028
; WAIT:
; D 6013 86 0B 00 01    TESTXI R11 0001
; D 6017 A1 00 13       IFFALSEI WAIT                      Wait for the trigger
; D 601A 11 0E 06 00    LOADXI R14 0600
; D 601E C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14
; D 6020 11 05 03 45    LOADXI R5 0345                     R5 = the bottom-right cell
; D 6024 11 02 00 51    LOADXI R2 0051                     R2 = where we are
; D 6028 11 03 00 02    LOADXI R3 0002                     R3 = heading: 0 up 1 right 2 down 3 left
; D 602C 10 00 6F       LOADAI 006F
; D 602F 2F 02 08 00    WRITEIDX R2 0800
; D 6033 11 0A 00 6F    LOADXI R10 006F
; D 6037 23 00 2B       COPYXY R2 -> R11
; D 603A BD 01 7C       CALL DRAW
; D 603D 11 09 00 00    LOADXI R9 0000                     R9 = steps
; STEP:
; D 6041 87 25          TESTXY R2 = R5
; D 6043 A0 00 E2       IFTRUEI SOLVED
; D 6046 23 00 34       COPYXY R3 -> R4
; D 6049 52 04 00 03    ADDXI R4 0003                      first try: heading +1 (right hand) or +3 = -1 (left)
; D 604D 86 04 00 04    TESTXI R4 0004
; D 6051 A0 00 65       IFTRUEI W4
; D 6054 86 04 00 05    TESTXI R4 0005
; D 6058 A0 00 6C       IFTRUEI W5
; D 605B 86 04 00 06    TESTXI R4 0006
; D 605F A0 00 73       IFTRUEI W6
; D 6062 B0 00 77       GAL TRY
; W4:
; D 6065 11 04 00 00    LOADXI R4 0000
; D 6069 B0 00 77       GAL TRY
; W5:
; D 606C 11 04 00 01    LOADXI R4 0001
; D 6070 B0 00 77       GAL TRY
; W6:
; D 6073 11 04 00 02    LOADXI R4 0002
; TRY:
; D 6077 BD 01 43       CALL OFF                           R6 = the wall that way, R7 = the cell beyond
; D 607A 2E 06 08 00    READIDX R6 0800
; D 607E 81 00 23       TESTAI 0023
; D 6081 A1 00 94       IFFALSEI FOUND                     Open
; D 6084 42 04          INCX R4                            Blocked: turn right one
; D 6086 86 04 00 04    TESTXI R4 0004
; D 608A A1 00 77       IFFALSEI TRY
; D 608D 11 04 00 00    LOADXI R4 0000
; D 6091 B0 00 77       GAL TRY
; FOUND:
; D 6094 42 09          INCX R9
; D 6096 2E 07 08 00    READIDX R7 0800
; D 609A 81 00 6F       TESTAI 006F
; D 609D A0 00 BE       IFTRUEI BACK                       Stepping back onto the path
; D 60A0 10 00 6F       LOADAI 006F
; D 60A3 2F 06 08 00    WRITEIDX R6 0800
; D 60A7 2F 07 08 00    WRITEIDX R7 0800
; D 60AB 11 0A 00 6F    LOADXI R10 006F
; D 60AF 23 00 6B       COPYXY R6 -> R11
; D 60B2 BD 01 7C       CALL DRAW
; D 60B5 23 00 7B       COPYXY R7 -> R11
; D 60B8 BD 01 7C       CALL DRAW
; D 60BB B0 00 D9       GAL MOVED
; BACK:
; D 60BE 10 00 2E       LOADAI 002E
; D 60C1 2F 02 08 00    WRITEIDX R2 0800
; D 60C5 2F 06 08 00    WRITEIDX R6 0800
; D 60C9 11 0A 00 2E    LOADXI R10 002E
; D 60CD 23 00 2B       COPYXY R2 -> R11
; D 60D0 BD 01 7C       CALL DRAW
; D 60D3 23 00 6B       COPYXY R6 -> R11
; D 60D6 BD 01 7C       CALL DRAW
; MOVED:
; D 60D9 23 00 72       COPYXY R7 -> R2
; D 60DC 23 00 43       COPYXY R4 -> R3
; D 60DF B0 00 41       GAL STEP
; SOLVED:
; D 60E2 C7 00          SETMULTI 00                        Lock
; D 60E4 86 01 00 01    TESTXI R1 0001
; D 60E8 A0 01 0A       IFTRUEI SECOND                     R1 = 1: the other one got here first and told us
; D 60EB 11 07 00 01    LOADXI R7 0001
; D 60EF D3 21 17       COPYVXY save R7 -> VM2 R1          Tell the other: you're 2nd
; D 60F2 D3 21 89       COPYVXY save R9 -> VM2 R8          and how many steps we took
; D 60F5 11 0E 06 21    LOADXI R14 0621
; D 60F9 C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14                       1st
; D 60FB 23 00 94       COPYXY R9 -> R4
; D 60FE BD 01 BA       CALL PRNUM
; D 6101 11 0E 06 5B    LOADXI R14 065B
; D 6105 C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14
; D 6107 C7 01          SETMULTI 01                        Unlock (held through the printing)
; D 6109 00             HALT                               The winner is done
; SECOND:
; D 610A 23 00 86       COPYXY R8 -> R6                    R6 = the winner's steps (PRNUM uses R8)
; D 610D 11 0E 06 3E    LOADXI R14 063E
; D 6111 C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14                       2nd
; D 6113 23 00 94       COPYXY R9 -> R4
; D 6116 BD 01 BA       CALL PRNUM
; D 6119 11 0E 06 5B    LOADXI R14 065B
; D 611D C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14
; D 611F 11 0E 06 62    LOADXI R14 0662
; D 6123 C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14                       The score line
; D 6125 23 00 64       COPYXY R6 -> R4
; D 6128 BD 01 BA       CALL PRNUM
; D 612B 11 0E 06 7F    LOADXI R14 067F
; D 612F C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14
; D 6131 23 00 94       COPYXY R9 -> R4
; D 6134 BD 01 BA       CALL PRNUM
; D 6137 11 0E 06 8A    LOADXI R14 068A
; D 613B C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14
; D 613D C7 01          SETMULTI 01                        Unlock
; D 613F 00             HALT
; D 6140 F0 00 00       BREAK
; OFF:
; D 6143 23 00 26       COPYXY R2 -> R6
; D 6146 86 04 00 00    TESTXI R4 0000
; D 614A A0 01 62       IFTRUEI OU
; D 614D 86 04 00 01    TESTXI R4 0001
; D 6151 A0 01 69       IFTRUEI OR
; D 6154 86 04 00 02    TESTXI R4 0002
; D 6158 A0 01 70       IFTRUEI OD
; D 615B 53 06 00 01    SUBXI R6 0001                      left
; D 615F B0 01 74       GAL ON
; OU:
; D 6162 53 06 00 28    SUBXI R6 0028
; D 6166 B0 01 74       GAL ON
; OR:
; D 6169 52 06 00 01    ADDXI R6 0001
; D 616D B0 01 74       GAL ON
; OD:
; D 6170 52 06 00 28    ADDXI R6 0028
; ON:
; D 6174 50 66 07       ADDXYZ R6 + R6 -> R7
; D 6177 51 72 07       SUBXYZ R7 - R2 -> R7               next = 2 x wall - here
; D 617A BE 00          RETURN
; DRAW:
; D 617C C7 00          SETMULTI 00                        No switching mid escape sequence: the other solver draws too
; D 617E 4D BC          DIVXY R11 / R12                    row + 1, column
; D 6180 25             COPYMAA
; D 6181 21 0D          COPYAX Acc -> R13
; D 6183 52 0D 00 02    ADDXI R13 0002
; D 6187 27             COPYREMA
; D 6188 21 0E          COPYAX Acc -> R14
; D 618A 52 0E 00 29    ADDXI R14 0029
; D 618E BD 01 98       CALL POSXY
; D 6191 22 0A          COPYXA R10 -> Acc
; D 6193 C9             SEROUT
; D 6194 C7 01          SETMULTI 01
; D 6196 BE 00          RETURN
; POSXY:
; D 6198 CA 1B          SEROUTI 1B
; D 619A CA 5B          SEROUTI 5B '['
; D 619C 4D DF          DIVXY R13 / R15
; D 619E 25             COPYMAA
; D 619F 4E 00 30       ADDAI 0030
; D 61A2 C9             SEROUT
; D 61A3 27             COPYREMA
; D 61A4 4E 00 30       ADDAI 0030
; D 61A7 C9             SEROUT
; D 61A8 CA 3B          SEROUTI 3B ';'
; D 61AA 4D EF          DIVXY R14 / R15
; D 61AC 25             COPYMAA
; D 61AD 4E 00 30       ADDAI 0030
; D 61B0 C9             SEROUT
; D 61B1 27             COPYREMA
; D 61B2 4E 00 30       ADDAI 0030
; D 61B5 C9             SEROUT
; D 61B6 CA 48          SEROUTI 48 'H'
; D 61B8 BE 00          RETURN
; PRNUM:
; D 61BA 11 08 00 00    LOADXI R8 0000
; PN1:
; D 61BE 4D 4F          DIVXY R4 / R15
; D 61C0 27             COPYREMA
; D 61C1 70 00          PUSHA Acc                          digits onto the stack
; D 61C3 42 08          INCX R8
; D 61C5 25             COPYMAA
; D 61C6 21 04          COPYAX Acc -> R4
; D 61C8 8C 04          TESTXZ R4
; D 61CA A1 01 BE       IFFALSEI PN1
; PN2:
; D 61CD 71 00          POPA Acc
; D 61CF 4E 00 30       ADDAI 0030
; D 61D2 C9             SEROUT
; D 61D3 43 08          DECX R8
; D 61D5 8C 08          TESTXZ R8
; D 61D7 A1 01 CD       IFFALSEI PN2
; D 61DA BE 00          RETURN

